From: Meatwo310 <git@meatwo310.net>
Subject: [PATCH] platform/surface: gpe: support Surface Pro 9 Business

The Surface Pro 9 Business uses the same lid GPE as the standard
Surface Pro 9, but reports a different DMI product SKU.

diff --git a/drivers/platform/surface/surface_gpe.c b/drivers/platform/surface/surface_gpe.c
--- a/drivers/platform/surface/surface_gpe.c
+++ b/drivers/platform/surface/surface_gpe.c
@@ -124,6 +124,18 @@ static const struct dmi_system_id dmi_lid_device_table[] = {
 		},
 		.driver_data = (void *)lid_device_props_l52,
 	},
+	{
+		/*
+		 * We match for SKU here due to product name clash with the ARM
+		 * version.
+		 */
+		.ident = "Surface Pro 9 Business",
+		.matches = {
+			DMI_EXACT_MATCH(DMI_SYS_VENDOR, "Microsoft Corporation"),
+			DMI_EXACT_MATCH(DMI_PRODUCT_SKU, "Surface_Pro_9_for_Business_2038"),
+		},
+		.driver_data = (void *)lid_device_props_l52,
+	},
 	{
 		.ident = "Surface Book 1",
 		.matches = {
